      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah i get the \"both sides\" thing but i'm looking for more specifics on the negatives. the article i saw mentioned that the labor shortages alone could spiral into a massive depression because of how much industries like agriculture and construction rely on migrant workers. can you find some data or expert opinions that back up how bad those specific economic disruptions would actually be?",
